    "predecessor_defect": "The predecessor admits VENUE_AND_SITE whenever a kickoff bound is known, even when venue_identity is null and venue_identity_state is SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ABSENT. Site orientation and venue identity are therefore conflated, and a downstream consumer cannot distinguish an authoritative venue from an unknown one.",
